<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#9679;</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">whether
                                            and the extent to which our technology and processes infringe on intellectual property of
                                            the licensor that is not subject to the licensing agreement;</span></td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p><div>

