cannot predict the outcome of lawsuits and cannot ensure that the results of any such actions will not have a material adverse effect
on our business, financial condition and results of operations. Any intellectual property litigation to which we might become a party,
or for which we are required to provide indemnification, regardless of the merit of the claim or our defenses, may require us to do one
or more of the following:</span></p><div>

