</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our revenue trend is reflective
of our pre-commercial state. Given that we are focused on the longer-term value proposition of utility scale quantum computers, our short-term
revenue is generated from strategic revenue arrangements with customers with whom we can co-develop quantum algorithms, validate commercial
use cases, and ensure that our technology is aligned with real-world demand, thereby being able to leverage and advance our core R&amp;D
roadmap.</p><div>

