<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</td><td style="text-align: justify">align the interests of our executive officers with those of our shareholders by tying a meaningful portion
of compensation directly to the long-term value and growth of our business;</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

