<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</td><td style="text-align: justify">continue to foster an entrepreneurial and results-driven culture; and</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

