</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">We continue to evaluate our philosophy
and compensation program as circumstances require and review compensation on an annual basis. As part of this review process, we are guided
by the philosophy and objectives outlined above, as well as other factors which may become relevant.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: italic bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: italic bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Compensation Consultant and Benchmarking</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">White and Gale (&#8220;W&amp;G&#8221;),
