to the Omnibus Plan, including rules and regulations relating to sub-plans established for the purpose of satisfying applicable foreign
laws or for qualifying for favorable tax treatment under applicable foreign laws; and</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

