<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</td><td style="text-align: justify">increases the percentage of Class B Subordinate Voting Shares reserved for issuance under the Omnibus
Plan, except pursuant to the provisions in the Omnibus Plan which permit the Plan Administrator to make equitable adjustments in the event
of transactions affecting the Company or its capital;</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

