                                            qualified, based on their talents, experience, functional expertise and personal skills,
                                            character and qualities having regard to our current and future plans and objectives, as
                                            well as anticipated regulatory and market developments;</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

