</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Further, this summary does
not address the U.S. federal non-income tax considerations, including estate or gift tax considerations, the Medicare contribution tax
on net investment income, the alternative minimum tax considerations, the special tax accounting rules under Section 451(b) of the Code,
or any U.S. state, local, or non-U.S. tax considerations of the ownership or disposition of the Shares.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"></p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 147 --><div>
    </div><div style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><p style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->140<!-- Field: /Sequence --></p></div><div>
