as of December 31, 2025. Because this is the Company&#8217;s initial period of operations, there are no comparative prior-period financial
statements presented.</p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in">&#160;</p>

