financial obligations. These advances are non-interest bearing and are due on demand. As of December 31, 2025, the Company owed Old Xanadu
$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-26900">1,818</ix:nonFraction>, which is included in Due to related party in the accompanying balance sheet. There were no formal repayment terms in place as
