Loan shall be used to advance and commercialize Old Xanadu&#8217;s quantum products. As of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, Old Xanadu
had received C$3,375 and C$2,920, respectively, in gross proceeds from the FedDev Loan.</p><div>

