</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">The FedDev Loan is repayable in 60 monthly
installments commencing on April&#160;1, 2027. As the FedDev Loan originated through a government program with regulated interest, a market
rate of interest is not imputed in accordance with the scope exclusions of ASC&#160;835.</p><div>

