</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">In 2018, Silicon Valley Bank was issued
34,000 warrants. All 34,000 warrants issued have an exercise price of C$0.29 per share and a 10-year term from their original issuance.
